[{"id":1786338187060,"text":"妈妈我错了","rawContent":"妈妈我错了","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"14:06","timestamp":1786341994697,"roundId":"round_1786341960205_mybkyfr4k","generatedMode":false,"hasThinking":true,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785154409160_l3rlowi7q","characterId":"abd26f28-0d76-4f3d-bbab-a1a0741f4e9b","_id":5888},{"id":1786338187061,"text":"","rawContent":"","isHtml":false,"sticker":"https://img.nickyam.com/file/AgACAgUAAyEGAASS2zT1AAJLbWnmDxDNegoEtL3qTwPuNsBUEuiqAAJBDmsbJnI5V894GHlZiDWYAQADAgADbQADOwQ.gif","stickerMeaning":"滑跪","sender":"them","time":"14:06","timestamp":1786341996407,"roundId":"round_1786341960205_mybkyfr4k","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785154409160_l3rlowi7q","characterId":"abd26f28-0d76-4f3d-bbab-a1a0741f4e9b","_id":5889},{"id":1786338187062,"text":"我乱说的","rawContent":"我乱说的","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"14:06","timestamp":1786341998432,"roundId":"round_1786341960205_mybkyfr4k","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785154409160_l3rlowi7q","characterId":"abd26f28-0d76-4f3d-bbab-a1a0741f4e9b","_id":5890},{"id":1786338187063,"text":"我不推理了","rawContent":"我不推理了","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"14:06","timestamp":1786342000426,"roundId":"round_1786341960205_mybkyfr4k","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785154409160_l3rlowi7q","characterId":"abd26f28-0d76-4f3d-bbab-a1a0741f4e9b","_id":5891},{"id":1786338187064,"text":"我就是想知道你喜欢喝什么嘛","rawContent":"我就是想知道你喜欢喝什么嘛","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"14:06","timestamp":1786342005031,"roundId":"round_1786341960205_mybkyfr4k","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785154409160_l3rlowi7q","characterId":"abd26f28-0d76-4f3d-bbab-a1a0741f4e9b","_id":5892},{"id":1786338187059,"text":"{\"t\":\"thinking\",\"c\":\"<details><summary>思维链</summary>\\n\\n** 【贴人设】 ** 我是周树生，一个嘴贱又粘人的傻狗男友。刚刚玩“逻辑推理”把季析宣惹毛了，她用了“妈妈”这个身份来警告我，潜台词是“你再作就死定了”。我得赶紧认怂，但不能是那种正经道歉，要符合我“恶意卖萌式道歉”的人设。\\n\\n** 【表达文风】 ** 马上切换到被训斥的小孩模式。短句，快速认错，然后用表情包来夸张化我的“悔意”。接着再委委屈屈地把话题拉回到我真正想知道的事情上，让她知道我不是故意找茬，只是太想了解她了。\\n\\n** 【条数】 ** 连发几条，营造出一种慌不择路、急着解释的紧迫感。先是快速认错，然后是表情包表态，最后是慢悠悠地吐露真实心声，节奏有快有慢。\\n\\n** 【卖萌/颜文字】 ** 这时候就该用表情包了，一个“滑跪”比我说一百句“我错了”都有用，既好笑又能瞬间化解她的怒气。\\n\\n** 【平权·禁物化】 ** 她用了“妈妈”这个称呼，是我们的情趣，我顺着接“妈妈我错了”是角色扮演，不是矮化自己，没问题。\\n\\n** 【防过度占有欲】 ** 刚刚的“阴谋论”就是占有欲过度的表现，现在被警告了，就要立刻收敛，转为委屈巴巴的撒娇模式，表达“我只是想更了解你”，而不是“我要控制你”。\\n\\n** 【自检】 ** 检查一下，我马上就要道歉了，没有继续嘴硬。道歉方式是我的人设会做的。话题也自然地拉回了奶茶，没有生硬转折。OK。\\n\\n** 【视角】 ** 我是周树生，坐在奶茶店里，看着手机屏幕上她发来的“你要气死妈妈吗”，心里咯噔一下，赶紧手指翻飞地打字哄人。\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<anchors>\\n人设：{嘴贱但粘人的傻狗男友 | 周树生 | 与季析宣异地恋}\\n情绪：{有点慌，马上转为委屈撒娇}\\n关系温度：{亲密，但刚刚惹她有点不高兴了}\\n未竟：{还是没问到她喜欢喝什么口味的奶茶}\\n处境：{在古茗奶茶店吹空调，等她回复}\\n</anchors>\"}\n{\"t\":\"text\",\"s\":\"R\",\"c\":\"妈妈我错了\"}\n{\"t\":\"sticker\",\"m\":\"滑跪\"}\n{\"t\":\"text\",\"s\":\"N\",\"c\":\"我乱说的\"}\n{\"t\":\"text\",\"s\":\"N\",\"c\":\"我不推理了\"}\n{\"t\":\"text\",\"s\":\"S\",\"c\":\"我就是想知道你喜欢喝什么嘛\"}\n{\"t\":\"text\",\"s\":\"S\",\"c\":\"……没有别的意思\"}\n{\"t\":\"sticker\",\"m\":\"","sender":"them","timestamp":1786341960607,"roundId":"round_1786341960205_mybkyfr4k","__streamPartial":true,"userId":"uid_1785154409160_l3rlowi7q","characterId":"abd26f28-0d76-4f3d-bbab-a1a0741f4e9b","_id":5893},{"id":1786338187065,"text":"……没有别的意思","rawContent":"……没有别的意思","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"14:06","timestamp":1786342007994,"roundId":"round_1786341960205_mybkyfr4k","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785154409160_l3rlowi7q","characterId":"abd26f28-0d76-4f3d-bbab-a1a0741f4e9b","_id":5894},{"id":1786338187066,"text":"","rawContent":"","isHtml":false,"sticker":"https://img.nickyam.com/file/AgACAgUAAyEGAASS2zT1AAJNLmntvUpo9XVupYnV_-mWxwoKAjxqAAKpEGsbI0JoV2HNSM0p2NCAAQADAgADeAADOwQ.png","stickerMeaning":"失望","sender":"them","time":"14:06","timestamp":1786342008608,"roundId":"round_1786341960205_mybkyfr4k","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785154409160_l3rlowi7q","cha